  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A sphere of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> rolls along a horizontal plane with constant speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>. It encounters an inclined plane at angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> and climbs upward. Assuming that it rolls without slipping, how far up the sphere will travel?</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/112eafc3-3a82-4385-8caf-1940fab39a76-image.png\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 164px;\" /></p>",
